1. generated/emcc-settings.d.ts — derived from Emscripten
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`generated/emcc-settings.d.ts` is generated by
`scripts/generate-emcc-settings.mjs` from the `src/settings.js` (and
`tools/settings.py`) of the emsdk inside the pinned toolchain image. Every emcc
setting's documentation comment is **reproduced verbatim** from `src/settings.js`
as the JSDoc of the corresponding field; the setting names and their default
values also come from that file.

