--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. generated/occt-symbols.d.ts and generated/symbol-catalog.json — derived from
   Open CASCADE Technology
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`generated/occt-symbols.d.ts` and `generated/symbol-catalog.json` are generated
from the API surface of Open CASCADE Technology as exposed by the toolchain
image's binding generator. What they contain is limited to:

  - symbol names,
  - symbol kinds (`class`, `alias`, `enum`, `builtin`),
  - inheritance chains, and
  - the names of types referenced by members.

They contain no OCCT source code, no OCCT documentation or prose, and no member
signatures, parameter lists or return types.

Open CASCADE Technology is Copyright (c) OPEN CASCADE SAS and is licensed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 with the Open CASCADE
Exception 1.0. See https://dev.opencascade.org/resources/licensing.

The full OCCT-derived type surface — the declarations of every bound class and
member — is not in this package. It ships in the separate `libcascade` package,
under OCCT's own terms (LGPL-2.1 with the Open CASCADE Exception 1.0).
